  "bodyHash": "dc2b64e8cd111cd1",
  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8D40GHP.jpg\" width=\"1040\" height=\"543\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;-</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IGKNfoF.png\" width=\"1105\" height=\"75\"></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>፠---------------------------፠ ⋘ &bull; ⋙ ፠---------------------------፠</strong></span></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px;color:#808000\">「眼前數百，後繼無窮……它們似乎正從森林深處源源不絕地行進而來。這個國家的最後庇護所正面臨圍困。它的守護者們能否獲勝，還是說米魯尼爾將被死靈軍團所吞沒？」</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&emsp;&emsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">《米魯尼爾守護者》是一款PvE目標防禦地圖。在這裡，你可以使用奇幻RPG風格的技能、砲塔以及自定義的NPC盟友，來抵禦即將到來的死靈軍團對米魯尼爾城的圍攻。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">雖然這張地圖旨在供4至20名玩家遊玩，但也提供了單人模式選項，該模式會賦予你更多的NPC協助並降低難度。</span></strong></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p>&nbsp;፠---------------------------፠ ⋘ &bull; ⋙ ፠---------------------------፠</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9d9CK3r9xs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://blog.paniniamerica.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Join_Discord-logo.png\" width=\"604\" height=\"151\"></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>提交Bug反饋、獲取最新更新資訊、參與社區活動，更多精彩等你探索！</em></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;፠---------------------------፠ ⋘ &bull; ⋙ ፠---------------------------፠</strong></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kz21lW5oxsA?wmode=transparent\" height=\"935\" width=\"935\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tvHR9HI.jpg\" width=\"552\" height=\"288\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AgoPXuK.jpg\" width=\"551\" height=\"288\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FjZYlLy.jpg\" width=\"550\" height=\"281\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/66i5Chb.jpg\" width=\"550\" height=\"281\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2vUnlzp.png\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>፠---------------------------፠ ⋘ &bull; ⋙ ፠---------------------------፠</strong></span></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">፠ 超過50種視覺效果驚人且強大的法術/技能可供選擇，每種技能都擁有獨特的升級路線，賦予你全新的力量。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">፠ 3種不同類型的自定義盔甲，分別強調不同的職業角色。你也可以混搭它們，以獲得你最想要的最佳屬性加成組合。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">፠ 50多種自定義挑戰與進度！</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">፠ 穿越15波包含30多種獨特類型怪物的關卡，這些怪物各有其特殊的機制，還有數以百計的其他怪物不斷湧向米魯尼爾。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">፠ 強大且獨特的盟友NPC和砲塔會為你和你的國家而戰。它們的動畫表現同樣精緻細膩。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">፠ 無需額外下載任何材質包/行為包/資源包。所有必需的依賴項會在世界載入時自動下載並載入。</span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iZ5iuAl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"361\" height=\"63\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>፠---------------------------፠ ⋘ &bull; ⋙ ፠---------------------------፠</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>資源包直接下載鏈接（適用於伺服器）：</strong></span><br><a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.dropbox.com/s/831x0ly3fljfdyz/Protectors Of Myrunir [Latest].zip?dl=1</a><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果你處於線上伺服器中，請啟用命令方塊和數據包。請勿使用可能會干擾原版數據包的插件。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>本地圖非常耗資。如果你使用的是Aternos或任何RAM小於3GB的服務器託管商，遊戲將會非常卡頓，尤其是當你與很多玩家一起遊玩時！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">一般規則：如果你與1或2位朋友一起玩，請至少分配3 GB RAM。每增加2名玩家，請額外增加1 GB RAM（以確保遊戲運行流暢）。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>技能使用教學影片：</strong><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oQPVJ828i2Q?wmode=transparent\" height=\"589\" width=\"589\"></iframe></span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/jeknjokmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">如果你覺得我值得支持，可以在這裡請我喝杯咖啡。</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:24px\">致謝</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">፠---------------------------፠ ⋘ &bull; ⋙ ፠---------------------------፠</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">建築：<br>城堡與房屋：<a rel=\"nofollow\">Nevas Buildings</a> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/project/the-city-of-iredale-part-1-medieval-world-project/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iredale城</a><br><br>靈感來源：<br><a rel=\"nofollow\">_BOBE</a>'s<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/project/defend-helms-deep/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">保衛聖盔谷</a><br><br>使用的工具：<br>World Edit模組<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fadvancements.thedestruc7i0n.ca%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">由thedestruc7i0n製作的進度生成器</a><br>頭盔素材取自<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft-heads.com%252fcustom-heads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://minecraft-heads.com/custom-heads</a><br>粒子生成器<br>ParticleConverter [ <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&redir_token=QUFFLUhqa0x3a1RJbkF5cmlEVmtSZ04yTEFhN19NdTBaQXxBQ3Jtc0tsblMtdlF1cUtERGFHeGNlS2NTLVZoMUltZ3F6ZHlQVmtVSkNOaEc2SndLY1lMNzJOUzlnc1p2aFVncFZ6Yl9DNWRtUV9jZlAzc19lV01jelVta0RtU0Y3VDZhYzFPT2VBSGFpTzQ5S3ZyUUYxMlp5MA&q=https://github.com/kemo14331/Particle-Converter/releases&v=1DjAt-WuJFA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/kemo14331/Particle...</a> ]<br>Java版動畫Blockbench插件<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.blockbench.net%252fplugins%252fanimated_java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.blockbench.net/plugins/animated_java</a><br><br>TextCraft：<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftextcraft.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://textcraft.net</a><br>文本內容：<br>矮人石頭工藝<br><br><br>音樂：<br>本地圖使用了以下音樂。如有遺漏，請聯繫我！<br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/account/manage/projects/5466541/ https:/www.planetminecraft.com/member/jeknjok/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">&gt;&gt; https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/jeknjok/</a><br><br>約科維克Boss主題曲<br>為你的權利而戰<br>音樂由Pixabay上的Playsound提供<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fmusic%252fmain-title-fight-for-your-rights-13529%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/music/main-title-fight-for-your-rights-13529/</a><br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">舊暴君Boss主題曲</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">貴族之家 by alexcardozomusic</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fmusic%252fmain-title-house-of-lords-cinematic-orchestral-8157%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://pixabay.com/music/main-title-house-of-lords-cinematic-orchestral-8157/</a><br><br>波次準備<br>威爾士道路上的史詩旅程<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fmusic%252fmain-title-epic-travel-on-celtic-roads-background-music-for-videos-5799%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/music/main-title-epic-travel-on-celtic-roads-background-music-for-videos-5799/</a><br><br>狼與龍之歌<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fmusic%252fmain-title-a-song-of-wolves-and-dragons-8034%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/music/main-title-a-song-of-wolves-and-dragons-8034/</a><br><br>戰鬥歌曲<br>王國來臨<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fmusic%252fmain-title-kingdom-come-draconis-battle-of-the-dragons-diferent-variant-8372%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/music/main-title-kingdom-come-draconis-battle-of-the-dragons-diferent-variant-8372/</a><br><br>龍之戰爭<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixabay.com%252fmusic%252fmain-title-battle-of-the-dragons-8037%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://pixabay.com/music/main-title-battle-of-the-dragons-8037/</a></span></p>",
